msgid "Installation"
msgstr "संस्थापनम्"

# automatic translation
#: install.docbook:5
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to obtain &kxstitch;"
msgstr "कथं प्राप्तव्यं &kxstitch;"

# automatic translation
#: install.docbook:6
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kxstitch; source can be found at <ulink "
"url=\"http://download.kde.org/stable/kxstitch/\">http://download.kde.org/"
"stable/kxstitch/</ulink>. The &kxstitch; homepage can be found at <ulink "
"url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/KXStitch\">http://userbase.kde.org/KXStitch</"
"ulink>"
msgstr ""
"इति &kxstitch; स्रोतः <ulink "
"url=\"http://download.kde.org/stable/kxstitch/\">http://download.kde.org/"
"stable/kxstitch/</ulink> इत्यत्र प्राप्यते । इति &kxstitch; मुखपृष्ठं "
"<ulink "
"url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/KXStitch\">http://userbase.kde.org/KXStitch</"
"ulink> इत्यत्र प्राप्यते"

# automatic translation
#: install.docbook:13
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "आवश्यकताएँ"

# automatic translation
#: install.docbook:14
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kxstitch; has been written with &Qt; 5.x and &kf5-full;."
msgstr "&kxstitch; इत्यनेन सह लिखितम् अस्ति &Qt; ५.x तथा &kf5-पूर्ण;।"

# automatic translation
#: install.docbook:17
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the image import functions the ImageMagick libraries are required, this "
"includes the development headers ImageMagick and Magick++, these are "
"available with your distribution or from <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/\">http://www.imagemagick.org/</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"इमेज आयातकार्यस्य कृते ImageMagick पुस्तकालयाः आवश्यकाः सन्ति, अस्मिन् "
"विकासशीर्षकाणि ImageMagick तथा Magick++ समाविष्टानि सन्ति, एते भवतः वितरणेन "
"सह अथवा <ulink url=\"http://www.imagemagick.org/\">http://www "
".imagemagick.org/</ulink> इति ।"

# automatic translation
#: install.docbook:24
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compilation and Installation"
msgstr "संकलन तथा स्थापना"

# automatic translation
#: install.docbook:25
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Compilation of KXStitch requires cmake and suitable build tools, make, gcc, "
"etc. A build script has been provided which should perform the necessary "
"compilation operations and install KXStitch for which you may be required "
"to enter the root password."
msgstr ""
"KXStitch इत्यस्य संकलनार्थं cmake तथा उपयुक्तानि build tools, make, gcc "
"इत्यादीनां आवश्यकता भवति।एकं build स्क्रिप्ट् प्रदत्ता अस्ति या आवश्यकानि "
"संकलनक्रियाः कर्तुं KXStitch संस्थापयितुं च अर्हति यस्य कृते भवद्भिः "
"मूलगुप्तशब्दं प्रविष्टुं आवश्यकं भवितुम् अर्हति"

# automatic translation
#: install.docbook:30
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid "<prompt>bash$</prompt><command>./build.sh</command>"
msgstr "<prompt>bash$</prompt><command>./build.sh</command> इति"